  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>rate <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>NO</mi><msup><mo>]</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msup><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msup></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/e342b981-546c-47ce-bb24-e034c0510ad4-image.png\" style=\"width: 641px; height: 191px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Order of reaction w.r.t. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NO</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>",
